# Your ledgers. The whole directory, not a pattern of it: it now holds one
# database per account, snapshots under data/backups/, and accounts.json —
# which carries the account NAMES. Back it up via Settings → Export.
# (the app creates this directory on first run, so it needn't be tracked —
# and git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded anyway)
/data/

